## English is the msgid itself, so every entry here is empty on purpose:
## Gettext falls back to the msgid when a translation is missing, and the
## msgid IS the English copy. The file exists so `mix gettext.merge` has an
## `en` to merge into and so a missing English catalogue can never be mistaken
## for a missing translation.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: en\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);\n"
